    <string name="keys_notes_line">In play mode: A S D F G H J K L are white keys, W E T Y U O P black. Z X move the octave, C V the velocity. Shift plays an octave up.</string>
    <string name="keys_nav_line">Arrows and Tab move between controls, and Enter presses. On a knob or fader Enter grabs it: the arrows turn it (Shift for fine) until Enter or Esc lets go, and + and - turn it without grabbing. Alt+Enter opens what a hold does.</string>
